---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Accessibility"><section class="section"><div class="wrap reading"><p class="eyebrow">ACCESSIBILITY</p><h1>Built for different ways of moving through the web.</h1><p>Kora targets WCAG 2.2 Level AA for public and administrative web experiences. The site supports keyboard navigation, semantic structure, visible focus, text zoom, responsive reflow, reduced motion and screen-reader announcements for forms and dynamic states.</p><p>If something prevents access, contact <a href="mailto:info@korasb.com">info@korasb.com</a> with the page and a description of the barrier.</p></div></section></SiteLayout>
